      "id": "claim_173c9378f70b46bea1dcc978ee54d45b",
      "statement": "Brijio's runtime is an explicit request/response chain: Agent -> MCP Server -> WebSocket Relay -> Browser Extension -> Browser Session, where the browser remains the source of truth and the extension is reactive (answers explicit requests, returns structured results, no ambient streaming).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://AGENTS.md#L38-L60",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:04ca3080466731e8f9b61dfb7de334f59f0e1af72138e5e9c570f2c25a692657:"
