      "id": "claim_3acb1087cf384fe19b542d718aa55cc3",
      "statement": "The MCP server is the agent-facing surface owning tools, resources, prompts, and skills; its HTTP runtime in src/http-server.ts uses the official MCP Streamable HTTP transport, requires a separate MCP_HTTP_AUTH_TOKEN bearer token, validates Host/Origin, and creates a throwaway WebSocket client per tool/resource call rather than holding a persistent connection.",
